      "id": 32926,
      "name": "Shadow Harmony [6]",
      "desc": "Equip to increase Agents' combat capabilities",
      "desc2": "Your reason fades, it falls away,\nLike madness creeping, here to stay.\nYour twisted arms grow fierce and tight,\nLike danger lurking out of sight.\nYou've locked yourself in endless night,\nWhere even I can't reach your light.\nYou shut me out, you look away,\nSo let me speak before I stray...\nWhen light returns and breaks the gloom,\nYour shadow slips back into view.\nNo matter what, love, hate, or fear,\nI'll stay right here—I'm always near.",
